From: sjcsf <346224915+llsf2020@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 09:05:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 05/12] FreeChat: delete disappearing messages locally from
 server markers

The server now purges expired messages without a redaction, so the client
removes its own copy:
- unsigned.com.freechat.expires_at hides and removes the message on time,
  offline too
- unsigned.com.freechat.read_ttl starts once every other member has read it
  (public receipts)
- while online, an ExpiryManager asks the server which marked messages
  still exist (existing_events) and drops purged ones, covering private
  receipts and clock drift
